    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/13c6135a404c2fb4af49c0ca0990842c.avif?t=1755613161\" width=517 height=101 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tense and Exciting Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat in the game adopts a turn-based system, which does not test the player's reaction speed but instead tests their patience and strategy. Although the game has a certain level of difficulty, as long as the player is patient, they can overcome all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Storyline:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's storyline is full of twists and turns, filled with surprises and unexpected developments. From being chased by the Demon God to solving the mystery of the temple, each task is a new challenge. The player will team up with their spirit servant to face various enemies and solve puzzles. The game's storyline draws inspiration from the core elements of wuxia novels, but with some modifications and adjustments, making it captivating and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/74350bb689c37e94f11d576b56811928.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/74350bb689c37e94f11d576b56811928.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/74350bb689c37e94f11d576b56811928.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and Equipment: Items such as potions are indispensable in the game. They not only help players progress smoothly but also enhance their combat power. Potions can be purchased from the shop, and monsters have a chance to drop them. After defeating monsters, players have a chance to obtain random equipment, which can significantly enhance their attributes and skill power. Higher-tier equipment can be obtained by investing in the shop, which can greatly enhance various attributes and skill power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5caba6a8d238e08a394938d231fe08a7.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5caba6a8d238e08a394938d231fe08a7.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5caba6a8d238e08a394938d231fe08a7.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill Growth:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill growth is tied to the player's own growth. As the player's level increases, their attributes and skill power will also increase. The power of skills can vary widely, sometimes dealing high damage, which depends on luck and equipment attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5b774ae2eb47e4a9e51175ecf969246b.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5b774ae2eb47e4a9e51175ecf969246b.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/5b774ae2eb47e4a9e51175ecf969246b.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Maps:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various maps, such as box-style maps and maze maps, which contain hidden treasures. Players need to explore carefully to discover these hidden treasures. The rich map design makes each exploration feel fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/710f20b1f6622e66622ee38cbfa80892.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/710f20b1f6622e66622ee38cbfa80892.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/710f20b1f6622e66622ee38cbfa80892.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Spell's Path (Ancient Spell's Path) is not only a traditional JRPG game but also an adventure full of challenges and surprises. Whether you enjoy wuxia novels or traditional turn-based RPGs, you can find your own fun here. Come join this adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/13c6135a404c2fb4af49c0ca0990842c.avif?t=1755613161\" width=517 height=101 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/13c6135a404c2fb4af49c0ca0990842c.avif?t=1755613161\" width=517 height=101 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tense and Exciting Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat in the game adopts a turn-based system, which does not test the player's reaction speed but instead tests their patience and strategy. Although the game has a certain level of difficulty, as long as the player is patient, they can overcome all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.poster.avif?t=1755613161\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.webm?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541750/extras/18caa3b4889279c23929c498b0109f1e.mp4?t=1755613161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Storyline:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's storyline is full of twists and turns, filled with surprises and unexpected developments. From being chased by the Demon God to solving the mystery of the temple, each task is a new challenge. The player will team up with their spirit servant to face various enemies and solve puzzles. The game's storyline draws inspiration from the core elements of wuxia novels, but with some modifications and adjustments, making it captivating and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s